  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0 — Initial release. 21 controls across Feedback,\n      Input, Layout, Data Display, and Utilities categories.\n\n      v1.1.0\n      Added:\n      - JanTable.ColumnDefinitions: new design-time column collection (JanTableColumn) with header text, width, sort/filter/resize/editable flags, and per-column color/font overrides. Editable directly from the Properties window via the standard collection editor.\n\n      Changed:\n      - JanTable.Rows is now runtime-only (LoadData, AddRow, RemoveRow, ClearRows) and no longer appears in the Properties window or supports design-time serialization, since List<string[]> isn't reliably supported by the WinForms designer's code/resource serializer.\n\n      Note: Existing code using janTable1.Columns and janTable1.Rows directly continues to work unchanged. ColumnDefinitions and Columns are independent — avoid mixing both on the same instance.",
